WEBVTT

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:10.640
Yusei...

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:12.590
Let's go, Mizoguchi.

00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:19.560
This light...

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:25.070
Yusei was finally able to Accel Synchro!

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:28.560
Kazama, I'm going to Yusei.

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:28.900
Right.

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:35.550
What's this light?

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:37.880
I feel it.

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:41.600
Yusei acquired a new power!

00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:42.830
Crow!

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:43.790
Where are you going?

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:45.950
I can't wait anymore!

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:47.750
I'm going to Yusei!

00:00:49.690 --> 00:00:51.660
Just wait, Yusei!

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:06.610
I finally caught up to your speed.

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:10.640
This is my new power!  Shooting Star Dragon!

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:13.340
You finally did it, Yusei.

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:19.320
That's the new monster you 
received from god's stone tablet.

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:24.160
But I'll never accept the 
power of a bug like you!

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:27.570
I activate Speed World 2's effect.

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:32.490
By removing 10 Speed Counters, 
I destroy Shooting Star Dragon!

00:01:32.630 --> 00:01:33.690
Take this!

00:01:34.930 --> 00:01:37.520
I activate Shooting Star Dragon's effect.

00:01:37.700 --> 00:01:40.370
I can remove this card from 
play once during your turn!

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:45.360
When I activate this effect, your 
monster's attack is negated!

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:49.290
You dodged my attack!

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:52.320
I end my turn.

00:01:52.510 --> 00:01:57.280
Due to Shooting Star Dragon's effect, 
it returns at the End Phase.

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:00.130
Let's go, Shooting Star Dragon!

00:02:00.130 --> 00:02:02.530
Let's start our counterattack!

00:02:04.660 --> 00:02:06.240
Riding Duels.

00:02:06.490 --> 00:02:09.350
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:16.210
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:37.470
Reach out your hand and 
grab a bright tomorrow

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:47.580
Soar in the infinite skies   BELIEVE IN NEXUS

00:02:48.210 --> 00:02:53.820
No one can stop my wild impulses

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:59.790
My hand sweats as the battle 
intensifies  This Heart Beat

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:05.560
I can't avoid this fearsome battle

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:11.140
I don't want it to end here  Go For It!!

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:17.510
Stand up  Don't tremble in fear alone

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:23.310
Remember that you have 
friends waiting for you

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:29.620
I'm not scared and I'll never give 
up, no matter how powerful the enemy

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:35.930
With real courage, I'll never lose

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:05.890
Iliaster's Three Emperors

00:04:09.980 --> 00:04:13.430
Placido had the right to brag.

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:18.490
Until now, only one Circuit 
appeared per duel.

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:22.070
But once he started dueling 
Yusei, many have appeared.

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:26.040
But this duel isn't enough to complete it.

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:30.050
We must use more of the Signers' powers.

00:04:34.260 --> 00:04:35.210
My turn!

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:40.070
Even if your monster 
evolves, my Meklord Emperor

00:04:40.070 --> 00:04:43.730
will use Skiel Carrier 5 to 
negate your first attack.

00:04:43.730 --> 00:04:48.530
And Wisel Guard 3's effect will stop 
your second attack from destroying it.

00:04:48.530 --> 00:04:53.200
You won't defeat Meklord Emperor easily 
because it has a powerful defense!

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:54.540
We'll see about that.

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:55.510
What?

00:04:55.510 --> 00:04:59.180
I activate Shooting Star Dragon's effect!

00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:04.060
Once per turn, I look at the 
top five cards in my deck.

00:05:04.060 --> 00:05:08.480
Shooting Star can attack one of your 
monsters for every Tuner Monster among them!

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:12.400
Shooting Star Dragon's effect 
lets it attack many times.

00:05:13.050 --> 00:05:17.880
I have to bet on Shooting Star 
Dragon's effect in order to beat him.

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:21.710
This draw of destiny will 
determine victory or defeat!

00:05:26.210 --> 00:05:29.300
Everyone, lend me your strength!

00:05:32.340 --> 00:05:33.430
Yusei is...

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:35.510
...asking for our help.

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:37.750
I'll give you as much power as you want!

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:43.220
I hope our thoughts reach Yusei.

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:52.840
The first card is the Tuner 
Monster Junk Synchron!

00:05:55.570 --> 00:05:59.440
The second card is the Tuner 
Monster Nitro Synchron!

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:04.500
The third card is the Tuner 
Monster Debris Dragon!

00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:09.810
The fourth card is the Tuner 
Monster Effect Veiler!

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:13.860
What?

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:24.220
This final draw is my future!

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:30.250
The fifth card is the Tuner 
Monster Hyper Synchron!

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:39.840
No way!  Five total attacks?

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:42.700
Go, Shooting Star Dragon!

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:45.000
Stardust Mirage!

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:57.170
Skiel Carrier 5's effect 
negates the first battle!

00:06:59.260 --> 00:07:01.730
Wisel Guard 3's effect activates!

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:06.200
It's not destroyed in battle once per turn, 
so the second battle is also pointless!

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:12.240
But it's now the third battle!

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:13.970
Attack Wisel Guard 3!

00:07:20.070 --> 00:07:23.170
The fourth battle!  Attack Wisel Attack 3!

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:30.100
And this is the final battle!

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:34.190
Shooting Star Dragon, attack Skiel Carrier 5!

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:45.480
Impossible!  A human defeated 
both Meklord Emperor and me?

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:09.860
Are you okay?

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:13.430
Don't feel pity for him because he lost.

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:19.880
He'd be more upset if he knew 
that you felt pity for him.

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:24.050
That's how men at his age feel.

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:31.430
You're the one who attacked Lua and Luca!

00:08:31.430 --> 00:08:34.200
That was just practice.

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:41.570
Placido stole your program 
and built the Diablo army.

00:08:41.570 --> 00:08:43.140
What a waste of time and effort.

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:45.830
He's in bad shape!

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:47.130
Program?

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:51.820
I see!  He stole our program 
and used it on Ghost!

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:54.750
He made Vice Director Yeager steal it,

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:58.780
and he's now in hiding because 
he feels that he's in danger.

00:08:59.070 --> 00:09:03.530
When you work for Placido, you 
don't have enough lives to spare.

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:07.690
How dare you take my cards without 
permission!  Give them back!

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:11.390
Well, I'm going to take your entire deck.

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:14.540
It doesn't look like you can move for awhile.

00:09:15.720 --> 00:09:16.880
Yusei!

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:19.150
Yusei, are you okay?

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:20.310
Yeah.

00:09:21.180 --> 00:09:22.220
Who are they?

00:09:54.180 --> 00:09:56.650
There's less electronic jamming.

00:09:58.480 --> 00:10:00.880
Yusei, they're...

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:09.220
Yusei Fudo, Jack Atlas and Crow Hogan.

00:10:09.220 --> 00:10:11.750
The participants have gathered.

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:17.300
This monument proves that 
Satellite and City are united.

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:22.160
Meeting you here shows the irony of destiny.

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:25.020
So you caused this incident!

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:26.860
Who are you?

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:30.930
I apologize for not introducing ourselves.

00:10:30.930 --> 00:10:33.850
We are Iliaster's three emperors.

00:10:34.140 --> 00:10:36.070
Iliaster's three emperors?

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:37.820
Iliaster?

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:39.940
I'm Jose, the leader.

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:42.280
What?  You're the leader?

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:47.390
Fine.  Then I'm the sub-leader Luciano.

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:51.060
And this is Placido, the one at the bottom.

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:55.030
Iliaster?  Why did you do 
this to Neo Domino City?

00:10:55.030 --> 00:10:59.170
Why?  We don't have to tell you.

00:10:59.170 --> 00:11:01.280
It's fine.  I'll tell you.

00:11:01.790 --> 00:11:03.030
Is it okay to tell them?

00:11:03.030 --> 00:11:06.080
Even if they know, they can't do anything.

00:11:06.090 --> 00:11:07.500
That's true.

00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:11.240
Our goal is to change the future.

00:11:11.970 --> 00:11:12.950
Future?

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:15.430
Yes, the future.

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:18.830
You don't need to tell us!

00:11:18.830 --> 00:11:20.660
We decide our own future!

00:11:20.660 --> 00:11:22.470
Oh really?

00:11:22.470 --> 00:11:26.640
Then everything is resolved!  Great!

00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:29.120
You're really stupid!

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:31.090
What, you punk?

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:34.030
It's not that simple!

00:11:34.030 --> 00:11:38.080
If you did what you're supposed to, 
we wouldn't have needed to come!

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:40.720
What do you mean by changing the future?

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:45.000
Don't tell me that you know the future?

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:46.780
We do know.

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:47.730
What?

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:52.020
You're going to create a horrible future!

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:53.340
How dare you!

00:11:53.340 --> 00:11:56.490
Luciano is telling the truth.

00:11:56.680 --> 00:12:02.690
Iliaster is an organization 
that repairs Earth's history.

00:12:02.690 --> 00:12:04.980
Repair history?

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:09.440
Our organization has been 
around since long ago.

00:12:09.440 --> 00:12:13.100
We've infiltrated many 
affairs around the world.

00:12:13.100 --> 00:12:18.640
No matter how hard you try, you'll 
never grasp the whole story.

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:24.610
Liar!  You're saying that the world's 
politicians and corporations belong to you?

00:12:24.610 --> 00:12:30.830
We can change the world without needing 
to let everyone know of our existence.

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:32.290
What do you mean?

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:41.430
Similar to a food pyramid for all living 
creatures, humans have a political power pyramid.

00:12:41.430 --> 00:12:47.550
We control the few humans at the top.

00:12:48.130 --> 00:12:54.720
In exchange for giving them advantages, 
we get to control the world's history.

00:12:54.720 --> 00:12:56.350
What?

00:12:56.350 --> 00:13:01.040
Does that mean you killed 
my father and mother?

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:01.680
Sherry?

00:13:02.060 --> 00:13:07.300
I don't remember everyone 
we erased to repair history.

00:13:07.460 --> 00:13:10.000
Then I'll make you remember!

00:13:11.880 --> 00:13:12.710
Sherry!

00:13:14.330 --> 00:13:16.640
I'll now get my revenge!

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:18.170
How disrespectful!

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:21.900
What?

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:25.380
That isn't good enough to kill me!

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:31.560
Miss!

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:50.380
What?

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:54.010
Your tricks don't work against us!

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:01.980
He beat someone as skilled as Mizoguchi!

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:03.400
Miss!

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:07.230
Humans are arrogant and greedy.

00:14:07.230 --> 00:14:13.250
Human history is a repetition 
of creation and destruction.

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:18.620
But Iliaster's power was always 
lurking in the shadows.

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:25.910
Whenever humans headed in the wrong 
direction, we suggested the correct path.

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:32.450
But we learned that no matter how much we 
repair history, there's a future we cannot avoid.

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:34.230
An unavoidable future?

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:40.290
Moment, which your father 
Professor Fudo invented,

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:42.920
will bring about a 
catastrophic future, Yusei.

00:14:43.790 --> 00:14:52.820
When Moment was created, we used Rutger 
Godwin to try to destroy Moment.

00:14:54.000 --> 00:15:04.220
But it was all wasted effort because Zero 
Reverse didn't erase Moment from history.

00:15:04.810 --> 00:15:12.520
Therefore, we decided to perform a new 
repair in order to get out of this situation.

00:15:12.520 --> 00:15:13.780
Repair?

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:16.960
We will destroy Neo Domino City.

00:15:16.960 --> 00:15:17.710
What?

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:20.530
You expect us to believe your lies?

00:15:21.340 --> 00:15:24.270
It's your choice whether 
you want to believe or not.

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:28.630
Yusei, your curse isn't over yet.

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:30.790
My curse?

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:33.050
I won't let you do this!

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:48.360
This is how you attack me?

00:15:48.360 --> 00:15:51.820
You're not a real duelist.

00:15:51.820 --> 00:15:53.170
Ma'am!

00:15:53.170 --> 00:15:57.400
We're only interested in real duelists.

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:09.020
I'll at least take your arm!

00:16:10.160 --> 00:16:12.480
There's no end to your foolishness.

00:16:14.940 --> 00:16:15.540
What?

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:20.660
Join your parents!

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:28.280
Father...  Mother...

00:16:28.810 --> 00:16:29.830
Miss!

00:16:32.730 --> 00:16:34.440
Sherry!  Mizoguchi!

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:44.540
Miss...

00:16:48.300 --> 00:16:53.640
Jose and Luciano, why do you 
want to destroy Neo Domino City?

00:16:55.780 --> 00:16:59.880
If you want to find out, show up at the WRGP.

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:02.400
We'll also enter.

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:04.360
What?  You will?

00:17:04.360 --> 00:17:08.140
All will be answered at the WRGP.

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:15.000
Mine has finally arrived.

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:17.980
What's that sound?

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:19.700
It's that!

00:17:20.720 --> 00:17:23.730
What is it?  It's coming this way!

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:25.220
Run!

00:17:26.130 --> 00:17:27.860
It's too late.

00:17:40.680 --> 00:17:42.290
The meteor stopped?

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:49.620
A stone tablet!

00:18:12.550 --> 00:18:15.040
What?  There's more?

00:18:15.630 --> 00:18:18.160
This is my power.

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:20.240
That's...

00:18:21.210 --> 00:18:23.800
Meklord Emperor Granel!

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:33.060
Team 5D's, keep winning in the 
WRGP if you want to battle us.

00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:35.390
The truth will be there!

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:37.230
Let's go!

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:39.740
I wonder if I can still use this.

00:18:41.030 --> 00:18:44.010
Farewell, Team 5D's.

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:45.830
Bye bye!

00:18:45.830 --> 00:18:46.810
Wait!

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:02.250
The lights are back on!

00:19:05.150 --> 00:19:07.300
Haruka, it's safe now.

00:19:07.300 --> 00:19:09.760
Thank you!

00:19:11.020 --> 00:19:14.240
What's going on?  Everything disappeared.

00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:15.930
Wait!

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:21.370
You knew that I would Accel Synchro.

00:19:25.530 --> 00:19:29.060
Accel Synchro Monsters evolve Synchros.

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:31.990
I received that card from a similar tablet.

00:19:32.490 --> 00:19:34.330
What's going on?

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:36.230
I don't know either.

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:42.290
All I knew was that you would 
eventually master Accel Synchro.

00:19:42.590 --> 00:19:50.090
However, if I think about it, if the one who 
gave you power is called the god of destiny,

00:19:50.300 --> 00:19:54.250
then he might be puzzled over 
what path should be taken.

00:19:54.740 --> 00:19:56.170
God of destiny...

00:19:57.090 --> 00:20:04.080
Yusei, you and your new Shooting Star Dragon 
may be the ones who choose the path.

00:20:10.820 --> 00:20:12.360
Sorry, Yusei.

00:20:12.730 --> 00:20:15.290
I don't know anything more.

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:18.050
But don't let your guard down.

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:21.890
Your battle against them is only beginning.

00:20:23.110 --> 00:20:29.580
Look!  Neo Domino City experienced 
a huge disaster during the WRGP.

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:35.130
Tens of D-Wheels were in accidents, 
and various highways were destroyed.

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:38.590
The surrounding buildings were also damaged.

00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:46.670
The Public Maintenance Department has suspended 
the WRGP preliminaries to investigate the cause.

00:20:47.560 --> 00:20:51.250
What?  There's no evidence of Iliaster?

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:55.890
Jack and Crow, did you make sure to talk 
to the Public Maintenance Department?

00:20:55.890 --> 00:20:56.610
Yeah.

00:20:57.000 --> 00:21:00.490
But all electronic devices 
didn't work at that time.

00:21:00.490 --> 00:21:05.370
There's no security camera footage, and the 
Ghosts' memory chips have all been erased.

00:21:04.440 --> 00:21:06.410
There's no evidence at all.

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:10.410
But we now know Iliaster's identity.

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:12.770
Yusei, what are you going to do?

00:21:13.150 --> 00:21:18.960
If Iliaster started the WRGP, that means 
they'll have traps waiting for us there.

00:21:19.110 --> 00:21:23.190
We'll play right into their hands 
if we participate in the WRGP.

00:21:23.850 --> 00:21:27.000
But we'll still participate in the WRGP.

00:21:27.370 --> 00:21:30.450
They said that they'll 
participate in the WRGP.

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:34.250
So that's where we'll 
settle things with them.

00:21:34.800 --> 00:21:37.320
We can't let that tragedy happen again.

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:40.860
I promise to stop them!

00:21:51.420 --> 00:21:56.790
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:21:57.260 --> 00:22:03.500
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you

00:22:16.450 --> 00:22:21.750
You always pretend and hide your fears

00:22:22.090 --> 00:22:27.390
You act tough and don't listen to anyone

00:22:27.690 --> 00:22:33.000
You do this over and over

00:22:33.360 --> 00:22:38.700
I shouted until my soul would break

00:22:38.970 --> 00:22:44.110
Hurry up and throw that away

00:22:44.640 --> 00:22:51.620
We're only heading towards tomorrow

00:22:52.050 --> 00:22:57.360
Close to you   If you're 
trying to find yourself

00:22:57.760 --> 00:23:03.190
Just keep doing what you ultimately decided

00:23:03.360 --> 00:23:08.630
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:23:09.130 --> 00:23:16.740
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you
